Provides: mcp-ollama-python
Replaces: mcp-ollama-python (<< 1.1.0~)
Breaks: mcp-ollama-python (<< 1.1.0~)
Description: Model Context Protocol server for local Ollama models
 mcp-server-ollama is a Python MCP server that exposes local Ollama
 models as tools for AI assistants (Windsurf, VS Code, Claude Desktop).
 .
 Provides utilities for:
  * Chat with local models (multi-turn, tool-calling)
  * Text generation and completions
  * Vector embeddings
  * Model management (list, pull, delete)
  * Running model inspection and process control
 .
 All operations run locally without cloud APIs.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-ollama
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.6.0),
 mcp-server-ollama (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers Ollama MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-ollama. Installing it registers
 the mcp-server-ollama binary as an available MCP server in the local
 mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
